 "إِبْرَٰهِيمَ", "translit": "َmyِhَٰrْbِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَقَوْمُ", "translit": "ُmْwَqَw", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لُوطٍ", "translit": "ٍṭwُl", "root": ""}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 44, "text": "وَأَصْحَٰبُ مَدْيَنَۖ وَكُذِّبَ مُوسَىٰ فَأَمْلَيْتُ لِلْكَٰفِرِينَ ثُمَّ أَخَذْتُهُمْۖ فَكَيْفَ كَانَ نَكِيرِ ", "translation": "And the inhabitants of Madyan. And Moses was denied, so I prolonged enjoyment for the disbelievers; then I seized them, and how [terrible] was My reproach.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَصْحَٰبُ", "translit": "ُbَٰḥْṣَaʾَw", "root": "صحب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مَدْيَنَ", "translit": "َnَyْdَm", "root": "مدن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَكُذِّبَ", "translit": "َbِّhdُkَw", "root": "كذب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مُوسَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَswُm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "فَأَمْلَيْتُ", "translit": "ُtْyَlْmَaʾَf", "root": "ملو"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لِلْكَٰفِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِfَٰkْlِl", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "أَخَذْتُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُtْhdَhkَaʾ", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "فَكَيْفَ", "translit": "َfْyَkَf", "root": "كيف"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "نَكِيرِ", "translit": "ِryِkَn", "root": "نكر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 45, "text": "فَكَأَيِّن مِّن قَرْيَةٍ أَهْلَكْنَٰهَا وَهِىَ ظَالِمَةٌ فَهِىَ خَاوِيَةٌ عَلَىٰ عُرُوشِهَا وَبِئْرٍ مُّعَطَّلَةٍ وَقَصْرٍ مَّشِيدٍ ", "translation": "And how many a city did We destroy while it was committing wrong - so it is [now] fallen into ruin[1] - and [how many] an abandoned well and [how many] a lofty palace.[2]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَكَأَيِّن", "translit": "nِّyَaʾَkَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِّن", "translit": "nِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "قَرْيَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَyْrَq", "root": "قري"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَهْلَكْنَٰهَا", "translit": "āَhَٰnْkَlْhَaʾ", "root": "هلك"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَهِىَ", "translit": "َàِhَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ظَالِمَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَmِlāَẓ", "root": "ظلم"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَهِىَ", "translit": "َàِhَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "خَاوِيَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَyِwāَhk", "root": "خوي"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "عُرُوشِهَا", "translit": "āَhِhswُrُʿع", "root": "عرش"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "وَبِئْرٍ", "translit": "ٍrْyʾِbَw", "root": "بار"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "مُّعَطَّلَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَlَّṭَʿعُّm", "root": "عطل"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "وَقَصْرٍ", "translit": "ٍrْṣَqَw", "root": "قصر"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "مَّشِيدٍ", "translit": "ٍdyِhsَّm", "root": "شيد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 46, "text": "أَفَلَمْ يَسِيرُوا۟ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ فَتَكُونَ لَهُمْ قُلُوبٌ يَعْقِلُونَ بِهَآ أَوْ ءَاذَانٌ يَسْمَعُونَ بِهَاۖ فَإِنَّهَا لَا تَعْمَى ٱلْأَبْصَٰرُ وَلَٰكِن تَعْمَى ٱلْقُلُوبُ ٱلَّتِى فِى ٱلصُّدُورِ ", "translation": "So have they not traveled through the earth and have hearts by which to reason and ears by which to hear? For indeed, it is not eyes that are blinded, but blinded are the hearts which are within the breasts.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَفَلَمْ", "translit": "ْmَlَfَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَسِيرُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُryِsَy", "root": "سير"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "translit": "ِḍْrَaʾْlٱ", "root": "ارض"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "فَتَكُونَ", "translit": "َnwُkَtَf", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "قُلُوبٌ", "translit": "ٌbwُlُq", "root": "قلب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "يَعْقِلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlِqْʿعَy", "root": "عقل"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "بِهَآ", "translit": "ٓāَhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "أَوْ", "translit": "ْwَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ءَاذَانٌ", "translit": "ٌnāَhdāَء", "root": "اذن"}, {"id": 